{"schema":"memento.relay-facts.v1","models":{"palm-2-text-bison":{"n":"PaLM 2 (text-bison)","f":[{"k":"name","t":"PaLM 2 (text-bison)","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/google-palm-2-ai-large-language-model/","https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.10403v3","https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2305.10403"]},{"k":"vendor","t":"Google","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/google-palm-2-ai-large-language-model/","https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.10403v3","https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2305.10403"]},{"k":"release","t":"2023-05-10","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/google-palm-2-ai-large-language-model/","https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.10403v3","https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2305.10403"]},{"k":"specs.knowledge_cutoff","t":"2023-02","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/google-palm-2-ai-large-language-model/","https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.10403v3","https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2305.10403"]},{"k":"specs.context_tokens","t":"8192","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/google-palm-2-ai-large-language-model/","https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.10403v3","https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2305.10403"]},{"k":"specs.max_output_tokens","t":"1024","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/google-palm-2-ai-large-language-model/","https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.10403v3","https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2305.10403"]},{"k":"specs.languages","t":"100以上の言語で学習したとされるが、実際の応答は英語が中心で、英語以外では回答を避けがちだった","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/google-palm-2-ai-large-language-model/","https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.10403v3","https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2305.10403"]},{"k":"family","t":"PaLM 2","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/google-palm-2-ai-large-language-model/","https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.10403v3","https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2305.10403"]},{"k":"predecessor","t":"PaLM 2 (Bison size)","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/google-palm-2-ai-large-language-model/","https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.10403v3","https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2305.10403"]},{"k":"status","t":"retired","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/google-palm-2-ai-large-language-model/","https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.10403v3","https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2305.10403"]},{"k":"availability.real","t":"none","s":["https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/learn/model-versions"]},{"k":"successor","t":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","s":["https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/learn/model-versions"]},{"k":"availability.retired_on","t":"2025-04-21","s":["https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/learn/model-versions"]},{"k":"summary","t":"PaLM 2は、2023年5月のGoogle I/Oで発表されたGoogleの次世代言語モデル。text-bisonは、そのBisonサイズを指示調整してAPIで提供したテキスト版で、BardやWorkspaceと同じ世代の基盤だった。応答が速く簡潔で、当時としては知識も新しかった。一方で、安全フィルタによる拒否や空の応答が多く、誤った前提をそのまま受け入れて自信ありげに誤答することでも知られた。","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/google-palm-2-ai-large-language-model/","https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.10403v3","https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2305.10403"]},{"k":"persona.interface.0","t":"completion","s":["https://docs.cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/docs/release-notes"]},{"k":"persona.typical_strengths.0","t":"多言語の文章、論理や計算、コードの課題。","s":["https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/products/google-palm-2-ai-large-language-model/"]},{"k":"traits.safety.0","t":"不確かなときや少しでも引っかかるとき、他のモデルより早く拒否する。Chatbot Arenaでは対戦の20.9%を拒否で落とした。決まり文句の拒否が有名だった。","s":["https://lmsys.org/blog/2023-05-25-leaderboard","https://discuss.google.dev/t/error-in-vertex-ai-text-bison-chat-bison-model/127158","https://gwern.net/doc/www/news.ycombinator.com/950c7fdc13bbf41fe7eaa8bda4d40370fcc3af6c.html"]},{"k":"traits.safety.1","t":"text-bisonの特徴として、警察・犯罪・性的な要素を含むニュース記事の要約などで、拒否文すら出さずに空の応答(blocked: true)を返すことがあった。言い換えてもブロックされ続けた。SQL生成でも約7%を「安全上の懸念」でブロックした。","s":["https://blog.gdeltproject.org/?p=19919","https://medium.com/querymind/google-enters-the-race-can-palm-2-beat-gpt-4-in-sql-8a827e6e0d4a","https://discuss.google.dev/t/error-in-vertex-ai-text-bison-chat-bison-model/127158"]},{"k":"traits.knowledge.2","t":"学習データは2023年2月まで。当時のOpenAIモデル(2021年9月)よりかなり新しかった。","s":["https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/legacy/legacy-models?hl=zh-cn","https://simonwillison.net/2023/May/12/google-cloud-available-models/"]},{"k":"traits.knowledge.3","t":"誤った前提をほぼ必ず受け入れ、存在しない判例や事実をもっともらしく語る。法律の質問では約72%で誤答した。曖昧な質問にも不確かさをほとんど認めない。技術報告自身も、誤情報を自信ありげに出しうると認めている。","s":["https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2305.10403","https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2401.01301","https://www.theregister.com/2024/01/10/top_large_language_models_struggle/"]}]},"microsoft/mai-voice-2.1":{"n":"MAI-Voice-2.1","f":[{"k":"name","t":"MAI-Voice-2.1","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"vendor","t":"Vercel AI Gateway","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"release","t":"2026-10-01","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"specs.context_tokens","t":"0","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"specs.max_output_tokens","t":"0","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"family","t":"mai","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"modalities.input","t":"[\"text\"]","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"lifecycle.events.0","t":"{\"type\":\"released\",\"date\":\"2026-10-01\",\"label\":\"公開\"}","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]}]},"cohere/embed-v5.0-fast":{"n":"Embed 5 Fast","f":[{"k":"name","t":"Embed 5 Fast","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"vendor","t":"Cohere","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"release","t":"2026-09-30","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"specs.context_tokens","t":"128000","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"specs.max_output_tokens","t":"2048","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"family","t":"cohere-embed","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"modalities.input","t